# POST /api/labor-types input rules: required code and name, code at most 40, name at most 120, rate 0..100,000,000, VAT
# 5/18/27 (422, reason in `detail`; exact limits pass). More: labor-types-vat-rates.http, labor-types-conflicts.http.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@Key = ZZW{{RunId}}

### [Setup][LaborTypes] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][LaborTypes] Login as admin (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Empty code (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Code and Name are required.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Whitespace-only name (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "   ", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Code and Name are required.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Code of 41 characters (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{'C'.repeat(41)}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Code must be at most 40 characters.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Name of 121 characters (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "{{'N'.repeat(121)}}", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Name must be at most 120 characters.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Negative hourly rate (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": -0.01, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Hourly rate over 100,000,000 (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": 100000000.01, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] Unsupported VAT rate 10 (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": 100, "vatRatePercent": 10 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "VAT rate must be 5, 18, or 27.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] A bad rate and a bad VAT together (422 expected, the rate is reported first)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": -1, "vatRatePercent": 10 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][LaborTypes] A non-numeric rate fails model binding (400 expected, never a server error)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "hourlyNetRate": "abc", "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 400

###

### [Positive][LaborTypes] The lower limits pass: rate 0, a 40-character code, a 120-character name (201 expected)
# @name lowest
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}{{'L'.repeat(40 - Key.length)}}", "name": "{{'N'.repeat(120)}}", "hourlyNetRate": 0, "vatRatePercent": 5 }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.code.length == 40
?? js response.parsedBody.name.length == 120
?? js response.parsedBody.hourlyNetRate == 0
?? js response.parsedBody.grossHourlyRate == 0

###

### [Positive][LaborTypes] The upper limit passes: rate 100,000,000 (201 expected, gross 127,000,000.00)
# @name highest
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{Key}}H", "name": "Highest Rate", "hourlyNetRate": 100000000, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.hourlyNetRate == 100000000
?? js response.parsedBody.grossHourlyRate == 127000000

###

### [Positive][LaborTypes] None of the refused requests created a row (200 expected, only the two boundary rows exist)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types?search={{Key}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.totalCount == 2

###

### [Cleanup][LaborTypes] Delete the lowest-limit labor type (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types/{{lowest.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][LaborTypes] Delete the highest-limit labor type (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/labor-types/{{highest.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
